WEBVTT

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:08.470
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:16.300
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:22.120
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:27.280
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:34.180
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.160
And then the light
that floods down...

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:45.130
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:53.240
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:00:53.410 --> 00:01:00.480
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:06.720
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:12.690
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:20.110
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:28.040
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:43.720
Flame Arrow!

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:47.130
We're gonna become Magic Knights!

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:51.770
Rayearth...

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:56.340
I have seen proof of thine heart
that remains firm in thy beliefs.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:16.960
Zagato...

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:20.120
Finally, I am yours and only yours.

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:36.540
This...

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:40.580
This can't be true.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:50.830
The Pillar of Cephiro
has been eradicated.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:54.030
This world is about
to turn toward darkness.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:59.200
W-Who are you?

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:01.230
Soon...

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:04.940
Soon everything will fall to extinction.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:07.170
Everything will disappear.

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:10.140
Not only Cephiro.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.840
Every world will become mine.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.490
A dream...

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:09.600
But that wasn't a dream.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.870
What happened in
Cephiro wasn't a dream.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:30.790
Good morning, Hikari.

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:39.030
Who...

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:40.970
...was that?

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:53.880
Who in the world was that?

00:04:54.290 --> 00:05:00.290
A Departure and New Ties

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:04.890
The Shidou School of Kendo
Shidou

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:39.800
Hikaru sure hasn't
been as cheerful lately.

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:44.970
She's been like this ever since
that field trip to Tokyo Tower.

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:51.610
Did something
happen at Tokyo Tower?

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:53.310
W-What do you think happened?

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:53.950
Souvenirs
W-What do you think happened?

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:58.210
Souvenirs
Maybe she was pushed away from
the souvenir stand by some tourists!

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:02.890
Or because she's so cute, Hikaru
was approached by shady guys!

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:11.120
I won't allow any guy to be
rude to our cute, little Hikaru!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.000
That's a given.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:17.400
Anyone who wants to date
Hikaru has to defeat all three of us...

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.630
...then start out by being pen pals!

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:21.640
Yeah!

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:36.160
Big Brother...

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:43.690
Won't you tell me why you
aren't as cheerful as usual?

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:48.740
Accomplish Your Original Intent

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:51.200
Accomplish Your Original Intent
I understand. Then I won't ask.

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.070
Accomplish Your Original Intent

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.430
I'm sorry...

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:57.740
...Big Brother.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:01.150
You wish to rid
your doubts by yourself.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:04.950
If that's what you decided,
Hikaru, follow through until the end.

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:11.250
Right.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:13.450
You're not being fair, Satoru!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:16.460
Hikaru, I'm worried about you too.

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:18.260
Masaru...

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:22.470
I'm worried about
cute, little Hikaru too!

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:26.400
If something's bothering you,
cry on my shoulder.

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:27.770
Kakeru...

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:31.700
Thank you.

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:37.950
Thank you, my dear brothers.

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:08.450
What's wrong, Umi dear?

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.710
Was something
wrong with my cooking?

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:13.250
Oh, no, it's not that, Mom.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:15.320
It's as good as ever.

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:17.820
What's really the matter, Umi?

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:20.390
You haven't been cheerful for a while.

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:23.930
And we haven't had your
homemade cakes in some time now.

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:28.770
No, it's nothing. I'm sorry.

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:31.200
I just don't feel hungry.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:36.800
If you aren't feeling well, perhaps
we should take you to a doctor?

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:39.270
It's all right, really.

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:42.350
Dad, Mom, I'm sorry to worry you.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:45.150
Perhaps you're
feeling a little lovesick?

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:47.440
N-Not at all!

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.020
You should be in love, Umi.

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:55.860
Because I fell in love, I married
someone as wonderful as your mother.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:57.650
Oh, you...

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:03.970
It's too early in the morning
to see the eternal honeymoon...

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:13.040
I only wish my
problem were romantic...

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:28.750
I will be on my way.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:32.790
Wait, Ms. Fuu!

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:36.930
Elder Sister...

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:41.770
Let's walk part of the way together.

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:55.020
Father and Mother are worried since
you have not been your usual self.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.410
I apologize.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.490
No need to apologize.

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:06.390
You usually work so hard not to put
any worries on Father and Mother.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:10.060
Something significant
must have happened.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:13.970
So, Ms. Fuu.

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:17.470
Is there someone who
understands those worries with you?

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:22.410
It is difficult to not have someone
that understands your worries.

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:24.780
However, if you are not alone...

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:30.650
If someone worries with you and finds
the solution to your worries with you...

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:33.520
...you will be all right.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:37.460
Right.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:41.920
By the way, was the reason you told
Mother you would be late tonight...

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.000
...because you are meeting them?

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:48.630
Yes, I promised I would meet them
today after school at Tokyo Tower.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.100
Tokyo Tower?

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:55.580
The chick pastries they sell
at Tokyo Tower are really delicious!

00:10:56.020 --> 00:11:00.080
W-Well then, I will buy some
as souvenirs today, Sister.

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:02.250
Thank you, Ms. Fuu.

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:14.830
Tokyo Tower is someplace
that we cannot forget...

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:50.630
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:56.640
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:08.720
Thank you...

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:11.360
Magic Knights...

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:20.260
Princess Emeraude...

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:29.470
Don't look like you're
going to start crying.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:32.270
You'll make me want to cry too.

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:35.210
Umi...

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.220
Are you not sleeping much lately?

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:40.150
You look a little pale.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:42.050
Fuu...

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:45.990
I have...

00:12:47.590 --> 00:12:50.590
I have dreams about Cephiro.

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:59.360
Cephiro, the place we
were summoned to from here...

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:03.330
The volcano, the ocean,
the mountain floating in the sky...

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:08.910
A mystical place that was supported
by Princess Emeraude, the Pillar.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.680
And the battle that took place there.

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:15.010
Princess Emeraude...

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:17.950
The Pillar of the
world known as Cephiro.

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:24.490
She supported the peace of
Cephiro with her will, all by herself.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:31.470
And I killed...

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.400
With my own hands...

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:37.440
Because I was hotheaded and
thought I was fighting for justice...

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.600
...and became a Magic Knight...

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:44.070
The reason why
Zagato started the fight...

00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:48.050
...and Princess Emeraude's true
feelings were things I didn't know.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:51.350
Hikaru, it was the same with me.

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:55.760
The three of us were summoned
to some weird world together.

00:13:56.300 --> 00:14:00.460
In the beginning, all I wanted
to do was get back to Tokyo...

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:06.600
But I was able to use magic,
got armor and weapons that evolved...

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:09.170
...and revived the Rune-Gods.

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:12.310
I thought that
I was doing something...

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:16.470
...to make Princess Emeraude
and everyone in Cephiro happy.

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:22.220
It was a world that was
just like a video game...

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:24.310
...yet it was all real.

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:30.730
The battle had no clear right or
wrong unlike those video games.

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:35.090
Everyone fought
for their own wishes...

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:38.640
...and that brought us
to such a sad ending.

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:47.580
I want to go
to Cephiro one more time!

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:51.210
Go to Cephiro one more time...

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:54.340
...and this time I want
to do something for that land...

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:58.050
...that the Pillar,
Princess Emeraude, protected so dearly!

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:00.320
Right.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:05.490
This light!

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:08.630
Just like when we were
summoned to Cephiro!

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:10.670
It is the same light!

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:34.990
W-Where?

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.090
Where in the world are we?

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.500
We're falling!

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:50.570
At this rate, we're going
to crash into the ground!

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:57.350
Oh, you are Mr. Clef's...

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:00.210
You're one of
Master Mage Clef's creatures!

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:03.750
You saved us!

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:05.950
Thank you!

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:08.090
That means...

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:10.930
...this is Cephiro?

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.830
That can't be!

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:14.890
It's completely different.

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:19.930
What about the ocean, the mountain
floating in the sky, and the volcano?

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:23.370
Hey, are you taking us somewhere?

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:34.610
A castle?

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:56.170
Mokona!

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:01.440
Mokona, how have you been?

00:17:01.550 --> 00:17:03.310
You're the real Mokona, right?

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:08.590
This fluffiness...
You really are Mokona!

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.660
It has been a while, Sir Mokona.

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:16.620
If Mokona is here...

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:19.490
Does that mean
this really is Cephiro?

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:27.370
Mokona wants us to follow.

00:17:27.470 --> 00:17:30.470
I see you still
understand what Mokona says.

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:32.880
Thanks!

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:33.910
See you!

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:42.250
If this is Cephiro,
how did we get here?

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:48.220
Supposedly, only the Pillar is able
to summon those from another world.

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:03.310
Here?

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:21.490
Clef!

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:27.660
Girls from another world...

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:33.400
I was the one who led you into that
battle without telling you anything.

00:18:35.610 --> 00:18:36.840
I'm sorry.

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:41.870
No.

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:46.810
You knew Princess Emeraude
had summoned us...

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:50.950
It must have been
hard for you too, Clef.

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:54.080
Umi.

00:18:56.030 --> 00:19:02.060
We couldn't do anything
for the princess, or for Cephiro.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.970
That is incorrect.

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:07.630
I'm sure you heard it too.

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:09.730
Princess Emeraude's last words...

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:15.170
Thank you...

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:17.850
Magic Knights...

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:24.820
You granted
Princess Emeraude's wish.

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:29.690
Princess Emeraude's wish...

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.960
But... Hikaru, Umi, Fuu.

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:34.830
Why are you here?

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:39.940
You supposedly returned to your
world after granting her wish.

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:42.770
We don't know either.

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:46.440
There was a flash of light
outside the Tokyo Tower windows...

00:19:46.550 --> 00:19:50.540
It was the same situation as when
Princess Emeraude summoned us.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:55.920
But only the Pillar should be able
to summon those from another world.

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:56.950
How...

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:59.120
So you didn't summon us?

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:02.480
I cannot summon you.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:07.030
In addition, no one currently
in Cephiro is capable of such a feat.

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:11.830
Because right now in Cephiro,
there is no Pillar.

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:33.220
I'm sure you saw
how Cephiro is now.

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:38.390
None of the beautiful landscape
that once existed remains.

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:41.430
As Cephiro has lost
its Pillar, it is crumbling...

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:44.130
No, it is beginning to disappear.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.460
Disappear...

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:49.110
That is not all.

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:52.900
Armies from other countries
have already reached this area.

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:46.230
A Cephiro without a Pillar.

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:49.370
If we are to attack,
now would be the time.

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:08.350
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:09.020 --> 00:22:16.290
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:23.290
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:27.800
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:28.170 --> 00:22:30.540
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:32.380 --> 00:22:35.680
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:36.050 --> 00:22:39.380
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:39.820 --> 00:22:46.730
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:22:47.160 --> 00:22:50.560
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:22:50.900 --> 00:22:59.330
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:02.170 --> 00:23:05.510
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:13.810
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:15.890 --> 00:23:22.690
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:33.330
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:33.670 --> 00:23:37.230
Cephiro is the target
of attack from three countries.

00:23:37.340 --> 00:23:40.440
It's because the Pillar,
Princess Emeraude, is gone.

00:23:40.550 --> 00:23:46.850
We decide to fight for Cephiro,
but Clef says there's no need for us to.

00:23:47.290 --> 00:23:50.020
But I will fight for Cephiro!

00:23:51.020 --> 00:23:53.010
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:23:53.130 --> 00:23:54.430
Cephiro and the Three Countries.

00:23:54.430 --> 00:23:55.760
Cephiro and the Three Countries
Cephiro and the Three Countries.

00:23:55.760 --> 00:23:57.630
Cephiro and the Three Countries
You have to watch it!

00:23:57.630 --> 00:23:58.430
Cephiro and the Three Countries

00:23:58.430 --> 00:24:05.360
Who is it today?

00:24:06.370 --> 00:24:08.340
Today, it's Fuu!

00:24:08.440 --> 00:24:09.310
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:09.310 --> 00:24:12.080
Look forward to the next episode!
Everyone, did you guess correctly?

00:24:12.080 --> 00:24:13.650
Look forward to the next episode!
Till next time!

00:24:13.650 --> 00:24:14.410
Look forward to the next episode!
